{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13252","headline":"送处州裴使君赴京 · 皇甫冉","name":"送处州裴使君赴京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"使君朝北阙，车骑发东方。\n别喜天书召，宁忧地脉长。\n山行朝复夕，水宿露爲霜。\n秋草连秦塞，孤帆落汉阳。\n新衔趋建礼，旧位识文昌。\n唯有东归客，应随南雁翔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13252.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13252","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}